The bowl is small, roughly 15 cm across at the rim, and it holds cut strawberries piled fairly full. Its inner volume is about 400 mL, and strawberry pieces packed into it with gaps would fill maybe 60% of that. That gives roughly 150-200 g of strawberries.

Strawberries have about 32 kcal per 100 g, so 180 g comes to roughly 58 kcal. The bowl looks a bit smaller than 15 cm, and the image shows it at about 220 px wide. The pixel scale is unknown, so I'll keep the estimate at about 180 g.

